      "sourcePath": "toolkits/instagram/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Instagram OAuth tokens are bound to the account selected in Facebook Login"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/instagram/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Instagram uses Business Login and only supported/verified scopes should be configured"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/instagram/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Instagram toolkit requires a Business/Creator account for supported business features"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/instagram/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Use `INSTAGRAM_LIST_ALL_MESSAGES` to fetch Instagram messages"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/instagram/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Instagram DM send failures with code 10/subcode 2534022 are Meta's 24-hour messaging window"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/instagram/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "For custom Instagram/Meta OAuth, configure the redirect URI in the Meta app"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/instagram/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "For Instagram DMs via n8n/Claude, Connect MCP can simplify setup"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/instagram/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "`INSTAGRAM_POST_IG_MEDIA_COMMENTS` failures can be caused by an incorrect `ig_media_id`"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/instagram/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Instagram is available as a toolkit and can be connected via a new authConfig"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/instagram/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Publish local media with `image_file` or `video_file`"
    }
